{"title":"2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A <i>magic square</i> is a grid of numbers in which the sum of the numbers in each row, in each column, and on each of the two main diagonals is equal to the same number (called the <i>magic constant</i>). \n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a\" title=\"2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a\">2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b\" title=\"2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b\">2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b</a></li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017215427\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 19/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 407